#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""iptinfo — clean-room metadata extractor for Autodesk Inventor .ipt files.

Works on Linux (tested on Bazzite KDE). Extracts: part title, author,
material, Inventor build, locale, save timestamps, template provenance,
and the embedded 512x512 PNG thumbnail.

Derived exclusively from observational format analysis (container parsing,
string scans, controlled diffs). No decompilation. Requires: python3-olefile.

Usage:
  iptinfo FILE.ipt [FILE2.ipt ...]     show info
  iptinfo --json FILE.ipt              JSON output
  iptinfo --thumbnail FILE.ipt out.png save thumbnail
  iptinfo --inventory FILE.ipt         stream inventory
"""
